-- misstated age or sex, incontestability, currency, the parties' rights, and changes.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are lines of ../../source/raw/manulife-cstd.txt, generated by
-- tools/vnsrc.py. Days are calendar days and months and years are calendar months and years
