§§ `Article 2 — The insurance contract`
-- src:208 | ĐIỀU 2  HỢP ĐỒNG BẢO HIỂM

-- 2.1 and 2.2 list the documents of the contract and define the application file; they set
-- no rule a case turns on.
-- src:211-224, not quoted: inert.

-- 2.3: the Company does not cover the insured, and the contract has no effect from the
-- start, without written consent of the insured (or, for a minor, of a parent or lawful
-- guardian), or without an insurable relationship.
-- src:245 | Công Ty sẽ không bảo hiểm cho Người Được Bảo Hiểm
