    `dividends and interest among them`

§§ `Article 7 — Misstated age or sex`
-- src:428 | ĐIỀU 7  TRƯỜNG HỢP KÊ KHAI SAI TUỔI
-- src:429 | VÀ/HOẶC GIỚI TÍNH

-- 7.1: when the true Tuổi is within the insurable range, (a) a premium paid that is lower than
-- the premium for the true age or sex reduces the sum insured to what the premium paid buys,
-- the policyholder continuing at the old premium; (b) a higher one is refunded, the excess
-- without interest. "phù hợp với khoản phí bảo hiểm đã đóng" is read as proportional to the
-- premium paid (fork F-7a). Equal premiums change nothing.
