DECLARE `An adjustment under Article 7.1` IS ONE OF
    `the sum insured is reduced to` HAS `the amount` IS A NUMBER
    `the excess premium is refunded` HAS `the amount` IS A NUMBER
    `no adjustment`

GIVEN `sum insured`            IS A NUMBER
      `premium paid`           IS A NUMBER
      `premium for the truth`  IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An adjustment under Article 7.1`
`7.1 — the adjustment for` `sum insured` `with` `premium paid` `paid against` `premium for the truth` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `premium paid` LESS THAN    `premium for the truth` THEN `the sum insured is reduced to` (`sum insured` TIMES `premium paid` DIVIDED BY `premium for the truth`)
        IF `premium paid` GREATER THAN `premium for the truth` THEN `the excess premium is refunded` (`premium paid` MINUS `premium for the truth`)
        OTHERWISE `no adjustment`

-- 7.2: when the true Tuổi is outside the insurable range of 1.3, the Company may cancel, and
-- then returns the greater of (a) the surrender value and (b) the premiums paid, without
-- interest, less benefits paid and Debt and less medical and underwriting costs; and claws
-- nothing back when the premiums are less than the deductions.
