GIVETH A NUMBER
`the greater of the surrender value` `surrender value` `and the premiums` `premiums paid` `less` `benefits paid and debt` `and` `medical and underwriting costs` MEANS
    max 0 (max `surrender value` (`premiums paid` MINUS `benefits paid and debt` MINUS `medical and underwriting costs`))

§§ `Article 8 — Incontestability`
-- src:470 | ĐIỀU 8  MIỄN TRUY XÉT

DECLARE `A kind of misstatement` IS ONE OF
    `of age or sex, under Article 7`
    `intentional, under Article 6`
    `intentional, of what would have led the Company to postpone or refuse cover`
    `an inaccurate statement or an omission otherwise`

-- 8.1: except for age or sex (Article 7) and intentional untruth (Article 6), an inaccurate
-- or omitted statement does not void the contract once it has been in force for at least 24
-- months from the issue date or the latest reinstatement, whichever is later. 8.2: nor for
-- an intentional failure to declare what would have led to postponement or refusal.
