DECLARE `The successor policyholder` IS ONE OF
    `the insured, with the Company's approval`
    `the insured's guardian, on applying and with the Company's approval`
    `the insured's guardian, if the conditions are met`
    `no successor, the insured not meeting the policyholder conditions`

GIVEN c IS A `The contract`
      d IS A DATE
      `the insured meets the policyholder conditions` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The successor policyholder`
`10.1 — the successor to the policyholder of` c `on` d `,` `the insured meets the policyholder conditions` MEANS
    IF `the insured's Tuổi under` c `on` d AT LEAST 18
    THEN IF   `the insured meets the policyholder conditions`
         THEN `the insured, with the Company's approval`
         ELSE `no successor, the insured not meeting the policyholder conditions`
    ELSE CONSIDER c's `policyholder`
         WHEN `an individual` b l f   THEN `the insured's guardian, on applying and with the Company's approval`
         WHEN `an organisation` l x   THEN `the insured's guardian, if the conditions are met`

-- 10.2(a)-(d): the death benefit goes to the beneficiaries alive (or still operating) at the
-- insured's death; to several, in equal shares unless the contract or the nomination says
-- otherwise; the share of one who died first is shared equally among the others; with no
-- beneficiary, or none surviving, to the policyholder or the policyholder's lawful heirs.
-- 10.2(e)(ii): for an organisation policyholder, with no validly nominated beneficiary, to
-- the insured's heirs. A nomination that states shares for some beneficiaries and not
-- others is not provided for.
